Web --> Visibility
Cron --> Visibility
Web --> Coordinator : 启动已受理执行
Cron --> Coordinator : 启动已受理执行
Subagent --> Coordinator : 提交后启动，待实现
Subagent --> Persistence : 原子受理，待实现
Visibility ..> Repo
Coordinator --> Factory : 装配运行对象
Coordinator "1" *-- "0..*" Session
